  "name": "Shape Water",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Water_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You shape water according to your will.</p><p>Choose a single cubic space of water or ice within <strong>Range 10</strong>.</p><p>You can move that water or ice to an adjacent space or lift it 1 space in the air, but no higher.</p><p>Alternatively, you can carefully sculpt water and ice while the spell is active, such as creating an ice sculpture, or clearing water from a both.</p><p>Additionally, you can freeze or unfreeze water instead of moving it.</p><p>This effect lasts for <strong>1+ES rounds</strong>, where ES is the number of extra successes.</p>",
